encoding  utf-8
survey Grebe_Swallet

#Grebe Swallet, Charterhouse
#Data from Willie Stanton's Survey Book 2 pp86 et seq
#In all cases bearings in the original are in degrees and minutes
#These are converted here to decimal degrees
#Typed in by Graham Mullan June 2010

input G1/G1.th
input G2/G2.th
equate 176@G1 176@G2

input G3/G3.th
equate 182@G2 182@G3

input G4/G4
equate 203@G3 203@G4

input G5/G5.th
equate 205@G4 205@G5

equate 210a@G4 210@G5

input G6/G6.th
equate 226@G5 226@G6

input G7/G7.th
equate 233@G6 233@G7

input G8/G8.th
equate 246@G7 246@G8

endsurvey